    title: "EICR Coding Explained: C1, C2, C3 and FI Codes in Full",
    slug: "eicr-coding-c1-c2-c3-fi-codes-explained",
    date: "September 2, 2026",
    isoDate: "2026-09-02",
    isoDateModified: "2026-09-02",
    author: "ECSPrep Editorial Team",
