    tags: ["Accessibility", "Website Design", "WCAG"],
    excerpt:
      "Website accessibility for electrician businesses explained simply: core WCAG basics, common mistakes, and why an accessible site wins more customers.",
    metaTitle: "Website Accessibility for Electrician Businesses: WCAG Guide",
